{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "7765d35175e44fbaa500446eb4271347",
    "m_Title": "Note",
    "m_Content": "虽然直接将子图（Sub Graph）中的“位置（Position）”输出，并直接连入顶点位移（Vertex Displacement）会很方便。\r\n\r\n但我们应该改用这种做法（即图中连线的逻辑），这样我们就不会对我们现有的每一个子图都去乘以（multiplying）物体位置（Object Position）了。",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": 672.0,
        "y": -629.0,
        "width": 200.0,
        "height": 199.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "454b2fa7d6b3419bb43c90a27e8b7c9b"
    }
}

